{
  "$schema": "folio-block-summaries/v1",
  "entry": "dspace-7-rest-contract",
  "summaries": [
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s713-relationship-between-the-access-conditions-of-th",
      "source": "sections/s713-relationship-between-the-access-conditions-of-th.md",
      "source_hash": "488bd73a6bdff61a224c05bd6557ad1a240defcb10385e9615289f5fdd46f689",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "How item and bitstream access conditions relate: access conditions set on a bitstream through the upload section override the item's. A bitstream with no access conditions of its own inherits the item's; one that has its own ignores the item's.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s714-workspaceitem-data-of-cc-license-sectiontype",
      "source": "sections/s714-workspaceitem-data-of-cc-license-sectiontype.md",
      "source_hash": "23c0ac8e51966bc515a91326000fbbd272919f11c23d2b8e7815997a9b33e4d2",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The cclicense section of a WorkspaceItem holds the Creative Commons licence: uri (the licence URI, usually stored in dc.rights.uri), rights (the licence name, usually stored in dc.rights) and file (the bitstream holding the licence). Each is null when no licence has been granted.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s715-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s715-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "e8df9e12db42fe4afbba6cd5c8d5011ab1c11eab18cc91133a9c9dfafaefe07b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Patch operations on the cclicense section take a JSON Patch body (RFC 6902); each successful one returns 200 with the new workspace item.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s716-add",
      "source": "sections/s716-add.md",
      "source_hash": "1514f962296e065ef26b54306c60915fd12f1714c00c15d8d0a1d31026603958",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Accepting a Creative Commons licence: a PATCH add of the licence URI, obtained from the Search CC License endpoint, at /sections/<form-name>/uri. dc.rights, dc.rights.uri and the RDF bitstream are then fetched from the Creative Commons API. A later add on the same path replaces the licence: the new one is added to the item and the old one deleted. Using add to replace follows RFC 6902 section 4.1, under which adding to an existing member replaces its value.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s717-remove",
      "source": "sections/s717-remove.md",
      "source_hash": "6fb2966eb69614a2704af1fe19a2a16f19da8683cc7068c376b1d10054cc5141",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Removing a granted Creative Commons licence: a PATCH remove on /sections/<form-name>/uri.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s718-workspaceitem-data-of-identifiers-sectiontype",
      "source": "sections/s718-workspaceitem-data-of-identifiers-sectiontype.md",
      "source_hash": "0adc99648683c9573a2d04c257267c1318b579af0178285948008f06a2e21a04",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The identifiers section of a WorkspaceItem lists the identifiers assigned to it, in the same structure as the item identifiers link. Each identifier has value (the identifier string, such as a DOI URL), identifierType (such as doi or handle), identifierStatus (where relevant, since some types are minted locally and then reserved or registered upstream) and type (the resource type, for context in the UI). The supported types are doi and handle.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s719-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s719-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "e092c1c91ed800fa890d54191804c8ae0e22c548d8c4da8c53fc914644af646f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The identifiers section has no PATCH operations; it only reports the identifiers currently assigned to the workspace item.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s720-workspaceitem-data-of-license-sectiontype",
      "source": "sections/s720-workspaceitem-data-of-license-sectiontype.md",
      "source_hash": "71b00e2ac0939607316b52e2d5c514271b1a0c63527dcc25a7915e2a0b5e2f9a",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The license section of a WorkspaceItem holds the deposit licence grant: granted (true or false), url (read-only; where the granted licence can be seen) and acceptanceDate (read-only; the acceptance time recorded in the licence bitstream's dcterms:dateAccepted, null for licences granted before DSpace 7).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s721-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s721-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "e8df9e12db42fe4afbba6cd5c8d5011ab1c11eab18cc91133a9c9dfafaefe07b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Patch operations on the license section take a JSON Patch body (RFC 6902); each successful one returns 200 with the new workspace item.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s722-add",
      "source": "sections/s722-add.md",
      "source_hash": "5c6c862d8fa8e0f60e0ddc216ef4a47486a47c79c2573dcc10d60458c373ad17",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Accepting the deposit licence: a PATCH add of true at /sections/<form-name>/granted, with before and after example documents showing granted, url and acceptanceDate being set. A later add on granted replaces the licence: a new licence bitstream is added and the old one deleted, so url and acceptanceDate change. Adding false rejects or removes the licence. Using add to replace follows RFC 6902 section 4.1.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s723-replace",
      "source": "sections/s723-replace.md",
      "source_hash": "8cacf604f0792869f93a9810f568efe534defd8ccb935b66897ca048886a786b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The licence can also be accepted or rejected by a replace on the granted path with true or false; the curl examples given use the add operation.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s724-remove",
      "source": "sections/s724-remove.md",
      "source_hash": "1caac75842792c9a198020f766b19d9b88523f6dbbad7ae4152f9f10efba1abf",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Removing a granted licence: a PATCH remove on /sections/license/granted, with example documents before and after.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
