    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s726-workspaceitem-data-of-submission-form-sectiontyp",
      "source": "sections/s726-workspaceitem-data-of-submission-form-sectiontyp.md",
      "source_hash": "f3933ec4c0d9ff38ba729e0275e819111a3e2ae3203753a858afe87c6d9d1c90",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The submission-form section of a WorkspaceItem holds the metadata collected by one submission form. Each key is a metadata field in dot form (such as dc.title or dc.contributor.author), and its value is an array ordered by place, each entry with value, authority (the authority key, if any), confidence (the authority confidence, or -1) and language (an ISO code, if any). Archived items model metadata the same way, but in a different place in the JSON, and are changed as described on the Modifying Metadata via PATCH page.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s727-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s727-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "5e2658f6c0eafe2f2396f98fb1200075a58c344cd30e5264c91397532f520fd8",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Patch operations on the submission-form section take a JSON Patch body (RFC 6902).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s728-add",
      "source": "sections/s728-add.md",
      "source_hash": "0d9b9320cbd0ac7ffa44b6870f2da52e0d203f6fff2ed602742045a8e1d495e9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Adding metadata in a submission form. A PATCH add on /sections/<form-name>/<metadata>/- appends a value (value, language, authority, confidence) to an existing field, and an add on /<metadata>/<index> inserts it at a zero-based position; worked examples append and then insert authors. A field not yet present must be initialised by adding an array of values at /sections/<form-name>/<metadata>, since appending to a missing path is not allowed; the same call with several values initialises or replaces all of a field's values. Using add to replace follows RFC 6902 section 4.1, and sending an array to the - position would create a nested array element (Appendix A.16).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s729-remove",
      "source": "sections/s729-remove.md",
      "source_hash": "39189748b7b1b323a9b9eb2d746942ffe3fb379782edb9a4b7a3d5847260e59d",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Removing metadata in a submission form: a PATCH remove on /sections/<form-name>/<metadata>/<index> removes one value, and a remove on /sections/<form-name>/<metadata> removes all values of the field; examples are given.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s730-replace",
      "source": "sections/s730-replace.md",
      "source_hash": "fa2f4695a507365430b144faa43c85f76add2bb94a5766df64987bde37522044",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Replacing metadata in a submission form. Replace changes existing information only; replacing a field not yet set is an error. Examples replace a title value and language at /sections/traditionalpageone/dc.title/0, and change just its language at /dc.title/0/language.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s731-move",
      "source": "sections/s731-move.md",
      "source_hash": "95156fe22050e3014d50f01cd1d3efff81a814d19adff3fe2cb1e021776dda5f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Reordering metadata values: a PATCH move from one index to another, for example moving the third author (/dc.contributor.author/2) to the first position (/dc.contributor.author/0).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s732-test-copy",
      "source": "sections/s732-test-copy.md",
      "source_hash": "e3292fa83866ca71799c4b9cd28b5d079052fa42d63b766676a93c8798dae645",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "There is no plan to implement the test and copy operations on the submission-form section for now.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
