    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s733-workspaceitem-data-of-sherpa-policies-sectiontyp",
      "source": "sections/s733-workspaceitem-data-of-sherpa-policies-sectiontyp.md",
      "source_hash": "1f790d57c8af469cc3eaa2f9e6d69867c083c373b47ee4deae0d1f1fd2aaf822",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The sherpaPolicies section of a WorkspaceItem holds the publisher open access policies retrieved from Sherpa/RoMEO: a retrievalTime and a sherpaResponse with the journal metadata (titles, ISSNs, publishers, DOAJ status) and its publisher policies, such as permitted versions, embargoes, licences, conditions and archiving locations. sherpaResponse is never empty; with no results it carries at least an error flag and a message. The section is left out entirely when the item has nothing, such as an ISSN, to query Sherpa/RoMEO with.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s734-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s734-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "c294068f8b8c8b9c5bd4974f13ab39d3a4097422a38ca649e8514288a02fea7d",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Patch operations on the sherpaPolicies section take a JSON Patch body (RFC 6902), but the section is almost read-only, since its data come straight from Sherpa; the only accepted change is removing retrievalTime.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s735-remove",
      "source": "sections/s735-remove.md",
      "source_hash": "489f45116f96869991e820b3724ec0acc2bc83ae03d4a4423b92d90081ebb195",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sherpa data are cached to limit load on the Sherpa web services. A PATCH remove of /sections/sherpaPolicies/retrievalTime forces a fresh call.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
