        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s736-workspaceitem-data-of-upload-sectiontype",
      "source": "sections/s736-workspaceitem-data-of-upload-sectiontype.md",
      "source_hash": "86d6171cd4b75648e57d35eaffd69ee925ef4497161d9541cc8696588d2cf6e1",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The upload section of a WorkspaceItem lists the user's uploaded files. Each file has metadata (in the same structure as the submission-form section), sizeBytes and checkSum (algorithm and value; both read-only, computed by the server on receipt), url (read-only; where the file can be downloaded) and accessConditions (the policies the user applied to the file).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s737-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s737-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "76588eb69d6ec337b7f34662005abaa11ac9754456cfbcbc581b9f782ed53511",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Patch operations on the upload section take a JSON Patch body (RFC 6902); each successful one returns 200 with the new workspace item. The general patch rules apply.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s738-add",
      "source": "sections/s738-add.md",
      "source_hash": "e17ac1edb54d33352df59ff09ae92de3e976dd1ccb8e6ccf872541d86ccee344",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "In the upload section, add is used to add metadata or access conditions to files already uploaded. A new file is uploaded with a multipart POST to the workspace items endpoint.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
